 "description": "Flis2015 - Plant clock gene circuit (P2011.2.1 PLM_71 ver 2)\nBioModels BIOMD0000000598 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000598_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 1000 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000598_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating; extended past the last time event (314)), sampling 1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 3.36e-06 of species peak (worst: cNI)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] cL_degr term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] cP_trsl term 4/6: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - cP: zero order, signed\n  [info] cE3n_degr term 4/5: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] cLUX_degr term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] cG_cZTL_assoc term 2/5: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - cG: zero order, signed; cZTL: zero order, signed\n  [info] cG_cZTL_assoc term 3/5: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - cG: zero order, signed; cZTL: zero order, signed\n  [info] time event(s) on 'offsetStep1' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_OFFSETSTEP1.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'amplitudeStep1' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_Q4.TXT (SET)\n  [info] 4 species/parameters given short names (Q1...) so USER expressions fit Kintecus's expression length limit; original ids are in the SPECIES comments column\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): Q1 = cCOP1d; Q2 = cCOP1n; Q3 = cE3n; p_offsetStep1 = offsetStep1; Q4 = amplitudeStep1",
